One unit of value

One unit of value for MIRA is one complete, usable photoshoot plan and moodboard generated for one submitted questionnaire.

This is the functional unit R. A result is “usable” when it is delivered, coherent and accepted without requiring a full workflow rerun.

Initial measurement boundary

Included in the first baseline:

Questionnaire/form input payload

n8n workflow execution, routing, retries and tool calls

Text and image model/API inference

Google Sheets/Docs and media storage or transfer

Railway-hosted application delivery and idle runtime

Initially excluded, with the exclusion disclosed rather than treated as zero:

upstream foundation-model training, because attributable provider data is not yet available;

end-user device energy, until a defensible device measurement method is selected.

Three-row lever table

Lever

Current assumption — honest guess

